@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix lexdcp: <http://www.w3.org/ns/lemon/decomp#>.

<http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/ns/lemon/decomp> <http://creativecommons.org/ns#license> <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>;
